      "side": 1,
      "message": "err, i\u0027m fairly certain that\u0027s wrong.  _ExpandAlias/`[alias]` is def used from repoconfig.\n\ni think you\u0027re confusing the purposes of those 2 config files.  repoconfig is for user settings that they customize directly.  `.repo/manifests.git/config` is for preserving settings from `repo init`, not for users to directly tweak.\n\ni suspect the superproject logic is buggy, and seems to be open-coded relative to main.py:_ExpandAlias.\n\nbut this speaks to use lacking proper docs for this user-facing config file.  the internal docs file seems to be pretty clear on manifests.git/config at least.",
